            <h4 style="color: #002147; border-bottom: 2px solid #004080; padding-bottom: 5px; font-size:20px; font-weight:600;">About Er. Shivam Mishra </h4>
            <p style="font-size:16px; font-family:Arial; line-height:30px; text-align:justify; line-height:30px;color:black;">
                Er. Shivam Mishra is currently serving as an Assistant Professor in the Electrical Engineering Department at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh. Along with his academic duties, he is also entrusted with important responsibilities as the Security Incharge and Deputy Coordinator of the Induction Program at the institute. He has completed his B.Tech in EEE from Galgotias College of Engineering & Technology (GCET), Greater Noida and his M.Tech from Madan Mohan Malaviya University of Technology (MMMUT), Gorakhpur, with specialization in Power Electronics and Drives. Er. Shivam Mishra has presented and published research papers in International Conferences. His academic and research interests include Electric Vehicles, Machine Learning .
            </p>


